          "claim": "The derivative of $(t,a)\\mapsto(t,q(t,a))$ at $(0,a_0)$ is block triangular with diagonal blocks $1$ and $I$, so is invertible. [F2] gives a smooth local inverse $a=a(t,q)$; restrict to its image, which is the actual projection domain.",
          "step": "2.1",
          "inputs": [
