          "quote": "Assume $\\mathrm{AC}_\\omega$ for the referenced cotangent and symplectic-action conventions. Work on affine Minkowski spacetime with inertial coordinates $x^0=ct,x^1,x^2,x^3$ in met",
          "uses": [
            "1.1",
