      "derivations": [
        {
          "id": "step-1-1",
          "claim": "Let $\\xi_0$ be unit translation in the $x^0$ direction. The dual pairing of [F2] gives $\\mu^{\\xi_0}=p_0=-P^0$, so $H=cP^0=-c\\mu^{\\xi_0}$. Since $\\iota_{\\xi_{\\mathcal O}}\\omega=-d\\mu^{\\xi_0}$ by [F1] and $\\iota_{X_H}\\omega=dH$ by [L2], $X_H=c\\,\\xi_{\\mathcal O}$. With the library fundamental-field convention, its integral curve is $z(t)=\\exp_G(-ct\\xi_0)\\cdot z(0)$.",
