          "planned_proof_status": "explicit definition/adopted premise; physical truth not deductively proved",
          "planned_scope": "Smooth finite-dimensional cotangent geometry; library omega=-dtheta convention; countable-choice supplier assumption; interpreted coordinate dimensions.",
